        <tr><td><code>jwt</code> (cookie)</td><td>Keeps you signed in</td><td>90 days, renewed while you use the site</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>connect.sid</code> (cookie)</td><td>One-time messages between pages (for example "Welcome!" after sign-up)</td><td>Until you close the browser</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>patv_dev</code> (cookie)</td><td>A random browser id used only for anti-abuse (welcome-bonus fairness and the hashed browser id in post safety data)</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
