      <% if (locals.memory && locals.memory.on_day) { %><li><b><%= locals.memory.on_day %>:</b> <a href="#incognito">Incognito</a> and <code>!bridge hide</code> now change only what the website shows; they no longer stop Pepe remembering what you say. <a href="#memory">Pepe's memory</a> has its own switch ("Pepe's memory" in Settings → Privacy, or <code>!remember off</code>).</li><% } %>
